+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the sum of `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, and `totalTokens` across every provider call in the turn, rather than only the final round's counts ([validated by: reports the sum of every provider call across two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L55)).
+- A turn that makes no tool calls reports that single provider call's usage unchanged ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
+- When only some rounds in a turn report usage, the rounds that reported are summed without producing `undefined` or `NaN`, and a turn where no round reported usage still reports `undefined` ([validated by: sums the rounds that reported usage when another omits it, and reports undefined when none did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L65)).
+
